  <title>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Copy settings</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>کپی تنظیمات</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Copia delle impostazioni</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Kopiowanie ustawień</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Копирование настроек</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Ayarları kopyala</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sao chép tùy chỉnh</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>OpenFormsWithSettingsBeingCopiedGroup</name>
    <id>23</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>MessageOpenForms</name>
      <id>25</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>The settings of some &lt;link OpenWindows>open windows&lt;/> are about to be copied to another user.
If you made any changes in these windows, the changes might not be copied.
It is recommended that you close the windows before copying the settings.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تنظیمات برخی &lt;link OpenWindows>پنجره‌های باز&lt;/> در شرف کپی به کاربر دیگر است.
اگر در این پنجره‌ها تغییری ایجاد کرده‌اید، ممکن است تغییرات کپی نشوند.
توصیه می‌شود پیش از کپی تنظیمات، پنجره‌ها را ببندید.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>В приложении есть &lt;link OpenWindows>открытые окна&lt;/>, настройки которых копируются другому пользователю, 
если в них были внесены изменения, то новые настройки могут быть не скопированы.
Рекомендуется закрыть перечисленные окна и повторить копирование.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Programın&lt;link OpenWindows>açık pencereleri vardır, &lt;/>ayarları başka bir kullanıcıya kopyalanır, 
bunlarda değişiklik yapılmışsa yeni ayarlar kopyalanmayabilir. 
Listelenen pencerelerin kapatılıp tekrar kopyalanması önerilir.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Trong chương trình có &lt;link OpenWindows>các cửa sổ đang mở&lt;/>mà có tùy chỉnh được sao chép cho người sử dụng khác, 
nếu trong đó có các thay đổi thì không thể sao chép các tùy chỉnh mới.
Nên đóng các cửa sổ kể trên và sao chép lại.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>The settings of some &lt;link OpenWindows>open windows&lt;/> are about to be copied to another user.
If you made any changes in these windows, the changes might not be copied.
It is recommended that you close the windows before copying the settings.
</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>The settings of some &lt;link OpenWindows>open windows&lt;/> are about to be copied to another user.
If you made any changes in these windows, the changes might not be copied.
It is recommended that you close the windows before copying the settings.
</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>MessageOpenFormsExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>27</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>MessageOpenFormsContextMenu</name>
        <id>26</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <formatted>true</formatted>
      <type>Label</type>
